---
import VotingPeriodBadge from "./VotingPeriodBadge.jsx";
---

<section class="relative py-16 sm:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 bg-gradient-to-b from-white via-slate-50 to-white overflow-hidden">

  <!-- Background Decoration -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-72 h-72 bg-primary-500/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-96 h-96 bg-yellow-400/10 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>

  <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-7xl">

    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="mb-14 text-center animate-fade-up">

      <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-primary-200 bg-primary-50 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-700">
        ✨ Galerie & Actualités
      </span>

      <h2 class="mt-6 text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900">
        Découvrez les candidates
        <span class="text-primary-600">2026</span>
      </h2>

      <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg sm:text-xl text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Elles sont jeunes, ambitieuses et fières de leurs origines. Chaque candidate porte une histoire, une langue, une tradition et un savoir-faire qui participent à la richesse culturelle du Bénin. Découvrez leur profil, puis choisissez celle que vous souhaitez soutenir.
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

      <!-- LEFT COLUMN -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-6">

        <!-- Main Slider -->
        <div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-[32px] bg-white shadow-[0_25px_80px_rgba(15,23,42,0.12)]">

          <div
            id="slider"
            class="flex transition-transform duration-700 ease-in-out"
          >

            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-full h-[420px] sm:h-[560px]">
              <img
                src="https://res.cloudinary.com/di21pnpda/image/upload/w_900,h_1100,c_fill,g_auto,f_auto,q_auto/v1787167100/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_20.04.37_ptf2cj.jpg"
                alt="Miss Gbévivi Bénin"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
                loading="eager"
              />
            </div>

          </div>

          <!-- Overlay -->
          <div class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/70 via-black/20 to-transparent p-8">

            <span class="inline-flex rounded-full bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-white">
            </span>

            <h3 class="mt-3 text-2xl font-bold text-white">
            </h3>

            <p class="mt-2 text-white/80">
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- Quick Stats -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4">

          <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-5 shadow-md border border-slate-100 text-center">
            <p class="text-3xl font-black text-primary-600">2026</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">
              Édition
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-5 shadow-md border border-slate-100 text-center">
            <p class="text-3xl font-black text-primary-600">100%</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">
              Sécurisé
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white p-5 shadow-md border border-slate-100 text-center">
            <p class="text-3xl font-black text-primary-600">🇧🇯</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1">
              Bénin
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- RIGHT COLUMN -->
      <div>

        <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[32px] bg-gradient-primary text-white p-8 shadow-[0_25px_80px_rgba(212,175,55,0.35)]">

          <div class="absolute -top-12 -right-12 h-40 w-40 rounded-full bg-white/10 blur-2xl"></div>

          <div class="relative">

            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8">

              <div class="flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-3xl bg-white/15 backdrop-blur-md">
                <span class="text-3xl">🗳️</span>
              </div>

              <div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold">
                  Votes Ouverts
                </h3>
                <p class="text-white/80">
                  Soutenez votre candidate
                </p>
              </div>

            </div>

            <p class="leading-relaxed text-white/90 mb-8">
              Chaque vote contribue à valoriser les jeunes ambassadrices de la
              culture béninoise. Votre soutien peut faire la différence.
            </p>

            <div class="space-y-4">

              <!-- Dates réelles, même source que la barre de progression
                   (Progress.jsx) : période pilotée depuis le manager. -->
              <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md p-5 border border-white/10">
                <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-white/70 mb-1">
                  Période de vote
                </p>
                <p class="font-bold text-lg italic">
                  <VotingPeriodBadge client:load />
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="rounded-3xl bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md p-5 border border-white/10">
                <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-white/70 mb-1">
                  Tarif officiel
                </p>
                <p class="font-bold text-lg italic">
                  À confirmer
                </p>
              </div>

            </div>

            <a
              href="#candidates"
              class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-white px-5 py-4 text-center font-bold text-primary-700 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02]"
            >
              🏆 Voir les candidates
            </a>

          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>